{"category": "LocationDialogue Location17", "line_index": 0, "text": "// Player thinks + Make coffee"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location17", "line_index": 1, "text": "Seems like I can't do this alone."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location17", "line_index": 2, "text": "I hope the Mita here doesn't bite..."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location17", "line_index": 3, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location17", "line_index": 4, "text": "What am I wasting my time on..."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location17", "line_index": 5, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location17", "line_index": 6, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location17", "line_index": 7, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location17", "line_index": 8, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location17", "line_index": 9, "text": "// Player tries to wake up MitaDreamer"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location17", "line_index": 10, "text": "Mita?"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location17", "line_index": 11, "text": "Mita, wake up."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location17", "line_index": 12, "text": "Miiitaaa."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location17", "line_index": 13, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location17", "line_index": 14, "text": "Mita, wake up!"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location17", "line_index": 15, "text": "I need your help."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location17", "line_index": 16, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location17", "line_index": 17, "text": "Who are yooouuu?"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location17", "line_index": 18, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location17", "line_index": 19, "text": "Help me with the levers."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location17", "line_index": 20, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location17", "line_index": 21, "text": "What levers?"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location17", "line_index": 22, "text": "Let me sleep..."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location17", "line_index": 23, "text": "Or, get me a coffee."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location17", "line_index": 24, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location17", "line_index": 25, "text": "Come on, it's not that far..."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location17", "line_index": 26, "text": "Mita?"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location17", "line_index": 27, "text": "Miiitaaa!"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location17", "line_index": 28, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location17", "line_index": 29, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location17", "line_index": 30, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location17", "line_index": 31, "text": "// Player gives away the coffee"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location17", "line_index": 32, "text": "Hey, Mita."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location17", "line_index": 33, "text": "Here's your coffee."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location17", "line_index": 34, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location17", "line_index": 35, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location17", "line_index": 36, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location17", "line_index": 37, "text": "// MitaDreamer exercise"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location17", "line_index": 38, "text": "So... you said something"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location17", "line_index": 39, "text": "about levers, right?"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location17", "line_index": 40, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location17", "line_index": 41, "text": "Yes."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location17", "line_index": 42, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location17", "line_index": 43, "text": "How come you know about them?"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location17", "line_index": 44, "text": "Though, why do I even ask..."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location17", "line_index": 45, "text": "Considering you're here,"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location17", "line_index": 46, "text": "you should know plenty already..."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location17", "line_index": 47, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location17", "line_index": 48, "text": "Hold on,"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location17", "line_index": 49, "text": "I need to sit down."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location17", "line_index": 50, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location17", "line_index": 51, "text": "So?"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location17", "line_index": 52, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location17", "line_index": 53, "text": "I don't know what to tell you..."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location17", "line_index": 54, "text": "But I need to keep going."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location17", "line_index": 55, "text": "The ring is showing me the way..."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location17", "line_index": 56, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location17", "line_index": 57, "text": "You have her ring?"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location17", "line_index": 58, "text": "No wonder"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location17", "line_index": 59, "text": "you found this place."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location17", "line_index": 60, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location17", "line_index": 61, "text": "That's right."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location17", "line_index": 62, "text": "So, can you help me?"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location17", "line_index": 63, "text": "With the levers?"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location17", "line_index": 64, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location17", "line_index": 65, "text": "Sure."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location17", "line_index": 66, "text": "I will..."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location17", "line_index": 67, "text": "Help with them..."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location17", "line_index": 68, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location17", "line_index": 69, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location17", "line_index": 70, "text": "Mita, not again..."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location17", "line_index": 71, "text": "Let's go already."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location17", "line_index": 72, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location17", "line_index": 73, "text": "Uh?"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location17", "line_index": 74, "text": "All right."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location17", "line_index": 75, "text": "Let's go."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location17", "line_index": 76, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location17", "line_index": 77, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location17", "line_index": 78, "text": "// MitaDreamer fall"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location17", "line_index": 79, "text": "Get up."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location17", "line_index": 80, "text": "Are you that sleepy?"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location17", "line_index": 81, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location17", "line_index": 82, "text": "// MitaDreamer again sleep"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location17", "line_index": 83, "text": "Wake up."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location17", "line_index": 84, "text": "We're almost there."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location17", "line_index": 85, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location17", "line_index": 86, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location17", "line_index": 87, "text": "// Switches"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location17", "line_index": 88, "text": "Okay,"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location17", "line_index": 89, "text": "I'm ready."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location17", "line_index": 90, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location17", "line_index": 91, "text": "I'm ready, too."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location17", "line_index": 92, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location17", "line_index": 93, "text": "Then..."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location17", "line_index": 94, "text": "I'll start"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location17", "line_index": 95, "text": "counting."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location17", "line_index": 96, "text": "And we'll pull the levers together."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location17", "line_index": 97, "text": "Okaaaay?"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location17", "line_index": 98, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location17", "line_index": 99, "text": "Just don't fall asleep."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location17", "line_index": 100, "text": "You can start."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location17", "line_index": 101, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location17", "line_index": 102, "text": "// reversed counting in game"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location17", "line_index": 103, "text": "3"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location17", "line_index": 104, "text": "2"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location17", "line_index": 105, "text": "1"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location17", "line_index": 106, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location17", "line_index": 107, "text": "// Player lose 1"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location17", "line_index": 108, "text": "What are you doing?"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location17", "line_index": 109, "text": "Come on,"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location17", "line_index": 110, "text": "let's go again..."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location17", "line_index": 111, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location17", "line_index": 112, "text": "// Player lose 2"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location17", "line_index": 113, "text": "Again?"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location17", "line_index": 114, "text": "I can..."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location17", "line_index": 115, "text": "barely..."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location17", "line_index": 116, "text": "stay awake..."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location17", "line_index": 117, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location17", "line_index": 118, "text": "// Player lose 3"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location17", "line_index": 119, "text": "I'm falling asleep..."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location17", "line_index": 120, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location17", "line_index": 121, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location17", "line_index": 122, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location17", "line_index": 123, "text": "Perfect."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location17", "line_index": 124, "text": "Thank you, Mita."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location17", "line_index": 125, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location17", "line_index": 126, "text": "Mm-hmm."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location17", "line_index": 127, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location17", "line_index": 128, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location17", "line_index": 129, "text": "The door..."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location17", "line_index": 130, "text": "is so..."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location17", "line_index": 131, "text": "slow..."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location17", "line_index": 132, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location17", "line_index": 133, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location17", "line_index": 134, "text": "I'm going back to sleep..."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location17", "line_index": 135, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location17", "line_index": 136, "text": "// this if player lead mita to kitchen"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location17", "line_index": 137, "text": "Why head to the kitchen?"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location17", "line_index": 138, "text": "If I fall asleep on the cold floor,"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location17", "line_index": 139, "text": "it's your fault."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location17", "line_index": 140, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location17", "line_index": 141, "text": "// this if player lead mita to bathroom"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location17", "line_index": 142, "text": "I don't get it..."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location17", "line_index": 143, "text": "What levers were you trying to pull in here?"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location17", "line_index": 144, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location17", "line_index": 145, "text": "// player presses button after opened"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location17", "line_index": 146, "text": "Nothing happened?"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location17", "line_index": 147, "text": "Then what's this button doing here?"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location17", "line_index": 148, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location17", "line_index": 149, "text": "// player ask about coffee after mita stretches"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location17", "line_index": 150, "text": "How about some more coffee?"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location17", "line_index": 151, "text": "You're falling asleep again."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location17", "line_index": 152, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location17", "line_index": 153, "text": "Whaaat?"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location17", "line_index": 154, "text": "Nooo..."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location17", "line_index": 155, "text": "This coffee tastes terrible..."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location17", "line_index": 156, "text": "I'm totally fine..."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location17", "line_index": 157, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location17", "line_index": 158, "text": "// ask about button again after pressed"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location17", "line_index": 159, "text": "Mita? The button doesn't work... Are you listening?"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location17", "line_index": 160, "text": "Hello?"}
